#ASSERT `Art 7(1) Articles 7(2) and 7(3) apply to the person` `a member of the Commissioner's staff` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7`
-- Second reading: only the three Article 7(1) names.  The reading changes nobody else.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 7(1) Articles 7(2) and 7(3) apply to the person` `a member of the Commissioner's staff` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.13 read as B`
#ASSERT `Art 7(1) Articles 7(2) and 7(3) apply to the person` `the Commissioner` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.13 read as B`
#ASSERT `Art 7(1) Articles 7(2) and 7(3) apply to the person` `the court` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.13 read as B`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 7(1) Articles 7(2) and 7(3) apply to the person` `any person` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.13 read as B`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 7(1) Articles 7(2) and 7(3) apply to the person` `the Minister` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.13 read as B`
#ASSERT `reading A of F2.13: a function exercised on the Commissioner's behalf carries the Commissioner's duties`
#ASSERT NOT `reading B of F2.13: only the persons the Articles name are bound`
